1342
02:11:18,760 --> 02:11:22,039
The beginning of the end, Osman...

1343
02:11:22,480 --> 02:11:24,959
The beginning of your end, Nayman.

1344
02:11:25,560 --> 02:11:27,479
Your end.

1345
02:11:27,960 --> 02:11:30,679
